{
  "abstract": "The inclusive reactions h+p\u2192 \u03c6 +X, (h= \u03c0 \u00b1, ,K \u00b1 ,p \u00b1 ), are studied for 0\u2a85 x F \u2a850.3 and p \u22a5 \u2a7d 1 GeV at 93 and and 63 GeV incident momentum. Differential cross sections d \u03c3 /d p \u22a5 2 and d\u03c3 /d x F are presented and are compared with predictions of the naive parton model.",
